                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The United States to Baron
                            Senfft von Pilsach, Dr.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center">[On account of the appropriation for protecting the interests
                    of the United States in the Samoan Islands.]</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Sept. 22, 1893. On account of expenses of transit home from
                    Apia, Samoa, to Berlin, Germany. $500</p>
                <p>Received this —— day of—, 189–, from F. J. Kieckhoeffer, disbursing clerk,
                    Department of State, live hundred dollars, in full payment of the above account.
                    $500.</p>
                <closer>—— ——.</closer>
            </div>
